    "body": "My gut feeling is we should leave the spec as-is and align on the Blink/WebKit behavior here (which is what the spec has currently), but checking with some other people.  The fact that Blink/WebKit violate the spec in various other ways makes changes to align with them in this regard without aligning in other ways a bit risky.",
