    "created_at": "2020-04-20T13:01:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-20T13:01:38Z",
    "body": "I ran a query today to figure out which values are being used. The total number of pages is 4,308,656. The `count` is distinct pages. 89,783 pages (~2.08%) use one or both of these attributes. The null row could be because only one attribute is used, or because they use a value other than digits (like `marginwidth=\"${foo}\"` in a script file). Of the pages that use them, ~98,5% specify `0` for both attributes.\r\n\r\nRow | count | margins |  \r\n-- | -- | -- | --\r\n1 | 88474 | 0,0 |  \r\n2 | 1191 | null |  \r\n3 | 32 | 1,1 |  \r\n4 | 20 | 2,2 |  \r\n5 | 11 | 5,5 |  \r\n6 | 10 | 5,2 |  \r\n7 | 8 | 1,0 |  \r\n8 | 7 | 10,10 |  \r\n9 | 4 | 0,5 |  \r\n10 | 3 | 0,100 |  \r\n11 | 3 | 5,0 |  \r\n12 | 2 | 0,10 |  \r\n13 | 2 | 10,0 |  \r\n14 | 2 | 3,3 |  \r\n15 | 2 | 3,2 |  \r\n16 | 2 | 2,0 |  \r\n17 | 2 | 0,150 |  \r\n18 | 1 | 3,0 |  \r\n19 | 1 | 3,5 |  \r\n20 | 1 | 8,8 |  \r\n21 | 1 | 30,0 |  \r\n22 | 1 | 3,1 |  \r\n23 | 1 | 0,1 |  \r\n24 | 1 | 7,3 |  \r\n25 | 1 | 4,4\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary>query</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nSELECT\r\nCOUNT(DISTINCT page) AS count,\r\nCONCAT(\r\nREGEXP_EXTRACT(match, r'(?i)\\smarginwidth\\s*=\\s*[\"\\']?(\\d+)'),\r\n',',\r\nREGEXP_EXTRACT(match, r'(?i)\\smarginheight\\s*=\\s*[\"\\']?(\\d+)')\r\n) AS margins\r\nFROM (\r\nSELECT page, url, REGEXP_EXTRACT(body, r'(?i)(<iframe\\s(?:[^>\\s]+\\s+)*\\smargin(?:width|height)\\s*=\\s*[^>]+>)') AS match FROM `httparchive.response_bodies.2020_03_01_desktop`\r\n) WHERE match IS NOT NULL\r\nGROUP BY margins\r\nORDER BY count DESC\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
