    "created_at": "2020-04-20T13:17:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-20T13:17:31Z",
    "body": "A proposal to get rid of almost all of the communication channel while preserving most of the web compat (at most would affect ~0.03% of pages, but likely fewer if they also set margins with CSS or with these attributes on the nested `body` element):\r\n\r\n* At the same time as doing other snapshots of `iframe` attributes (like `sandbox` and `allow`), check if either (or both?) the `marginwidth` or `marginheight` attributes are present. Store this as a boolean flag on the browsing context.\r\n* Change https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#the-page to instead of using \"The body element's container frame element's marginheight attribute\", use `0px` if the flag is set.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
